{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32854","headline":"留题姚氏山斋 · 李频","name":"留题姚氏山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未厌栖林趣，犹怀济世才。\n闲眠知道在，高步会时来。\n露滴从添砚，蝉吟便送杯。\n乱书离缥帙，迸笋出苔莓。\n异果因僧摘，幽窗爲燕开。\n春游何处尽，欲别几迟回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}